# Language Translator App

A simple web-based language translator built using Python and Flask.

## Features
- Translate text into multiple languages
- Simple and clean UI
- REST API backend

## How to Run
1. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt

2. Run the app:
   python app.py

3. Open in browser:
   http://127.0.0.1:5000

## Live Demo
Check it out here: [Live Translator](https://your-app-name.onrender.com)
